{"cells":[{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"4e0834d4","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.008475,"end_time":"2026-10-14T10:14:01.82666+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-14T10:14:01.818185+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["# Brain Tumour Segmentation & Classification with YOLOv11n-seg\n","**Pretrained YOLOv11n-seg | Fine-tuned on BriscMat | 5-Class Gated Pipeline**\n","\n","---\n","\n","## Overview\n","\n","This notebook fine-tunes the **pretrained `yolov11n-seg.pt`** model from Ultralytics on the BriscMat brain MRI dataset.  \n","YOLOv11n-seg is a nano-scale instance segmentation model — we reuse its backbone + neck + heads entirely,  \n","only retraining the final detection/segmentation heads for our 4 MRI tumour classes.\n","\n","### Pipeline\n","```\n","Input Image\n","    │\n","    ▼\n","Gate Check (NonMRI filter using YOLO confidence)\n","    │\n","    ▼\n","YOLOv11n-seg → BBox + Segmentation Mask + Class\n","    │\n","    ▼\n","Post-process → Per-image Classification + Dice/IoU metrics\n","```\n","\n","### Classes\n","| ID | Class |\n","|----|-------|\n","| 0 | No Tumor |\n","| 1 | Meningioma |\n","| 2 | Glioma |\n","| 3 | Pituitary |\n","\n","> **Note:** Non-MRI images are filtered before YOLO inference using a lightweight gate step."]},{"cell_type":"markdown","id":"26c428f8","metadata":{"papermill":{"duration":0.007469,"end_time":"2026-10-14T10:14:01.842405+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-14T10:14:01.834936+00:00","status":"completed"},"tags":[]},"source":["## 1. Install Dependencies"]},{"cell_type":"code","execution_count":1,"id":"72681cb8","metadata":{"execution":{"iopub.execute_input":"2026-10-14T10:14:01.858002Z","iopub.status.busy":"2026-10-14T10:14:01.857325Z","iopub.status.idle":"2026-10-14T10:14:48.435866Z","shell.execute_reply":"2026-10-14T10:14:48.43521Z"},"papermill":{"duration":46.587999,"end_time":"2026-10-14T10:14:48.437634+00:00","exception":false,"start_time":"2026-10-14T10:14:01.849635+00:00","statu